          "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> and <MATH_0002> be differential graded algebras.\nLet <MATH_0003> be a differential graded <MATH_0004>-bimodule with property\n(P). Let <MATH_0005> be a differential graded <MATH_0006>-module with property (P).\nThen <MATH_0007> is a differential graded <MATH_0008>-module which represents\n<MATH_0009> in <MATH_0010> and which has a filtration\n<MATH_0011>\nby differential graded submodules such that <MATH_0012>,\nthe inclusions <MATH_0013> are admissible monomorphisms,\nthe quotients <MATH_0014> are isomorphic as differential\ngraded <MATH_0015>-modules to a direct sum of <MATH_0016>.\n",
